      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 68: 🟡 `append_dependencies()` always calls `find_library(... REQUIRED)` right after the `NO_DEFAULT_PATH` lookup, so a dependency found in `${CURRENT_INSTALLED_DIR}` can be overwritten by a system copy. This can silently mix vcpkg and non-vcpkg libs (or pick wrong debug/release variants). Guard the fallback lookup with `if(NOT FFMPEG_DEPENDENCY_${lib_name}_${config})` before the second `find_library` call.",
      "revId": "4ab1344753e723eae9fb30b5e69b2b913158d386",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
    },
