      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T22:06:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upstream vcpkg code, kept identical to ease rebasing. The concern does not apply anyway: find_library caches its result, so the second call is a no-op once the first lookup succeeded.",
