      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 43: 🟡 The binary iteration uses command substitution (`for BINARY in $(find . -type f)`) and later executes an unquoted assembled command string. This is fragile for paths containing spaces/special chars and can break universal-binary merging on valid filesystem layouts. Iterate with `find ... -print0` + `while IFS\u003d read -r -d \u0027\u0027` and invoke `lipo` directly with quoted args/arrays.",
      "revId": "4ab1344753e723eae9fb30b5e69b2b913158d386",
